      "author": "github-actions[bot]",
      "description": "## Highlights\n\n- Expanded the task dashboard with today's completion overview and actionable overdue, due-today, and high-priority task lists. Tasks can be completed or opened directly from the dashboard.\n- Improved dashboard completion statistics to use tasks due in the selected period and exclude cancelled tasks.\n- Clarified the security and compatibility boundary for JavaScript-based Tasks queries, with better expression and placeholder error handling.\n- Improved type detection and performance logging coverage.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n- Minimum Obsidian version remains `1.8.7`.",
